            "text_YNTPXq": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Hometown Soccer Holdings and New York City FC are bringing a new MLS NEXT Pro club to Middlesex County, New Jersey. Professional soccer built for one of the most diverse and soccer-passionate communities in the country.<br/><br/>New York City FC will oversee all sporting operations, giving players a direct pathway to MLS and beyond. Hometown Soccer Holdings is building the infrastructure to match: a purpose-built stadium, deep community partnerships, and a club local youth can aspire to.</p><p>The name, crest, and colors are coming. Season ticket deposits are available now.</p>",
