                "text_Cbqrd6": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Hometown Soccer Holdings was founded by Tom Glick, and Chris Klein,, whose careers span leadership roles at Manchester City FC, the LA Galaxy, Major League Soccer, and beyond. Hometown Soccer has partnered with MLS and KKR to bring new clubs and purpose-built stadiums to cities across North America. Middlesex County is first.</p><p>New York City FC has established one of the most productive player development pipelines in Major League Soccer. Through MLS NEXT Pro, the club has consistently developed and promoted talent to the MLS first team and beyond, producing players who have gone on to represent clubs and national teams at the highest levels of the game. That track record comes to Middlesex County. New York City FC will oversee all sporting operations for the club, bringing professional coaching, elite player development infrastructure, and a direct pathway to MLS to Central New Jersey.</p>",
